| One CPU class of one file, in a translation unit of its own with a name of
| its own.  Both halves of that matter.  The variants share local label names,
| so two in one TU is a duplicate-symbol error; and the object FILE name is
| what tools/profiler/profreport.py resolves a sample address through, by way
| of the linker map, so four members called n68k_checksum.S.obj in one archive
| make every one of them read as whichever the map lookup happened to find.
| That is not a build problem, it is a profile that names the wrong routine.
